  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urban Water Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s principal development objectives are to (i) significantly increase access to the piped water system in Ghana&apos;s urban centers, with an emphasis on improving access, affordability and service reliability to the urban poor; and (ii) restoring long-termfinancial stability, viability and sustainability of the Ghana Water Company Limited.</narrative>
  </description>
